{
  "name": "qqq",
  "displayName": "qqq",
  "publisher": "gh555",
  "version": "15.14.5",
  "description": "soldier",
  "icon": "assets/icon.png",
  "engines": {
    "vscode": "^1.73.0"
  },
  "activationEvents": [
    "*",
    "onCommand:qqq.q1",
    "onCommand:qqq.q2",
    "onCommand:qqq.pure",
    "onCommand:qqq.allSettings",
    "onCommand:qqq.setInOrder",
    "onCommand:qqq.openFile",
    "onCommand:qqq.revealFileInFolder",
    "onCommand:qqq.renameFile",
    "onCommand:qqq.exportDoc",
    "onCommand:qqq.exportZip"
  ],
  "main": "./src/qqq.js",
  "contributes": {
    "configuration": [
      {
        "title": "☀️ 核心",
        "order": 10,
        "properties": {
          "qqq.performanceMode": {
            "order": 10,
            "type": "string",
            "default": "optmum",
            "enum": [
              "extreme",
              "accelerated",
              "optmum"
            ],
            "markdownEnumDescriptions": [
              "极限性能：只保留首帧，质量47",
              "加速模式：无论动图还是视频最多保留前2秒，7fps，质量47",
              "最优模式：动图保留完整时长，视频截取首中尾共4秒，均保留原始fps ，质量71"
            ],
            "markdownDescription": "☀️ 性能模式：控制预览生成滴质量和性能平衡。"
          },
          "qqq.ioEngine": {
            "order": 20,
            "type": "string",
            "default": "auto",
            "enum": [
              "auto",
              "python",
              "rust",
              "node"
            ],
            "markdownEnumDescriptions": [
              "自动选择最佳引擎",
              "Python 引擎",
              "Rust 引擎",
              "Node 引擎"
            ],
            "markdownDescription": "☀️ 选择 IO 引擎：控制使用哪种引擎处理剪贴板和文件操作。"
          },
          "qqq.transactionLevel": {
            "order": 40,
            "type": "string",
            "default": "half",
            "enum": [
              "full",
              "half"
            ],
            "markdownEnumDescriptions": [
              "全包（抗造优先）：一切“耗时操作”（如视频下载、批量文件、混合富文本等）都用事物包裹：显示进度条，支持反悔，抗极端异常，自动回滚。",
              "半包（轻便优先）：细分出耗时操作中滴“轻便操作”（如小于80m滴文件（文件夹）混合落盘、内存截图等）做简单粘贴：最快响应，无进度条，异常**无**回滚和清理。"
            ],
            "markdownDescription": "☀️ 事务包裹级别："
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "🛸 漫游器",
        "order": 20,
        "properties": {
          "qqq.showHistoryRecycleBin": {
            "order": 10,
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": true,
            "markdownDescription": "🛸 是否在文件导航中显示历史回收站。"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "👁️ 观察",
        "order": 30,
        "properties": {
          "qqq.frameSizeMode": {
            "order": 10,
            "type": "string",
            "default": "fix",
            "enum": [
              "large",
              "small",
              "fix"
            ],
            "markdownEnumDescriptions": [
              "大相框：512x288",
              "小相框：256x144",
              "Fix：根据图片尺寸自动选择相框"
            ],
            "markdownDescription": "👁️ 相框尺寸模式：控制预览图像滴显示尺寸。"
          },
          "qqq.cleanFreak": {
            "order": 20,
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": false,
            "markdownDescription": "👁️ 洁癖（防遮挡）：保存文档前，自动确保所有暗号（/path/）下方有足够空行，防止预览/内容遮挡。相框类型（图片/视频/GIF）计算动态 n（基于字体/行高，约15行）；非相框类型至少1行。只处理下方。"
          },
          "qqq.enlargeSmallImages": {
            "order": 30,
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": true,
            "markdownDescription": "👁️ 图片/视频预览时，小于相框（512×288）滴图片是否放大以填满相框。关闭时，小图保持原尺寸，只在相框中居中摆放。"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "🍌 html与富文本",
        "order": 40,
        "properties": {
          "qqq.downloadSecurityLevel": {
            "order": 10,
            "type": "string",
            "default": "1: 平衡",
            "enum": [
              "0: 最宽松",
              "1: 平衡",
              "2: 最严格"
            ],
            "enumDescriptions": [
              "11项安全开关全部关闭。",
              "11项安全开关开4项，关7项。 \n  \n    开启项包括: \n   ◉  http/https协议限制; \n ◉  重定向协议限制; \n ◉  下载锁; \n ◉  Header注入清洗。 ",
              "11项安全开关全部开启。 \n  \n  额外开启滴 7项是: \n  ◉  SSRF防护; \n ◉  路径越界防护; \n ◉  content-length/content-range预检; \n ◉  严格断点续传; \n ◉  符号链接防护; \n ◉  yt-dlp probe输出限制; \n ◉  Fail-fast。"
            ],
            "markdownDescription": "🍌 如果下载视频失败，可以在此尝试更宽松滴策略。具体取舍请查看 https://github.com/gh555com/qqq/blob/qq/docs/downloadSecurityLevel.md"
          },
          "qqq.forceTextFlowScheme": {
            "order": 20,
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": false,
            "markdownDescription": "🍌 强制消除 html 乱码。仅在遇到顽固 html（或富文本）乱码时勾选，其余时候确保无脑关闭（请无脑取消勾选）原因是，代价：牺牲排版精度。"
          },
          "qqq.autoDownload": {
            "order": 30,
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": true,
            "markdownDescription": "🍌 是否在检测到视频时自动下载"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "📦 doc导出设置",
        "order": 50,
        "properties": {
          "qqq.docExportImageResolution": {
            "order": 10,
            "type": "string",
            "default": "原始分辨率",
            "enum": [
              "原始分辨率",
              "相框分辨率"
            ],
            "markdownDescription": "📦 图片使用何种分辨率：",
            "markdownEnumDescriptions": [
              "得到原始精度。",
              "优势在于: 1、文件更小； 2、相框显示滴缩略图总能对应一个完整滴图片预览（不会因为 Word 页面尺寸限制导致 预览 被截断）。"
            ]
          },
          "qqq.docExportIncludeCipher": {
            "order": 20,
            "type": "boolean",
            "default": true,
            "markdownDescription": "📦 导出 图片暗号字符串（如：/\\qqq/739yp_2026.01.03__6__11.09.56.png\\\\/ ）。"
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "commands": [
      {
        "command": "qqq.q1",
        "title": "qqq: Paste (Ctrl+V)"
      },
      {
        "command": "qqq.q2",
        "title": "qqq: Navigate (F2)"
      },
      {
        "command": "qqq.pure",
        "title": "qqq: pure"
      },
      {
        "command": "qqq.allSettings",
        "title": "qqq: all settings"
      },
      {
        "command": "qqq.setInOrder",
        "title": "qqq: set in order (全局整理)"
      },
      {
        "command": "qqq.openFile",
        "title": "qqq: open file"
      },
      {
        "command": "qqq.revealFileInFolder",
        "title": "qqq: reveal in folder"
      },
      {
        "command": "qqq.renameFile",
        "title": "qqq: rename file"
      },
      {
        "command": "qqq.exportDoc",
        "title": "qqq: 导出文档 (Doc/Docx)"
      },
      {
        "command": "qqq.exportZip",
        "title": "qqq: 导出 ZIP"
      },
      {
        "command": "qqq.downloadVideosFromUrl",
        "title": "qqq: 在光标位置插入 YouTube 等网页视频"
      }
    ],
    "keybindings": [
      {
        "command": "qqq.q1",
        "key": "ctrl+v",
        "when": "editorTextFocus && !editorReadonly"
      },
      {
        "command": "qqq.q1",
        "key": "f2",
        "when": "editorTextFocus && !editorReadonly"
      },
      {
        "command": "qqq.q2",
        "key": "tab",
        "when": "editorTextFocus && !editorReadonly"
      },
      {
        "command": "qqq.q2",
        "key": "f6",
        "when": "editorTextFocus && !editorReadonly"
      },
      {
        "command": "qqq.exportDoc",
        "key": "ctrl+alt+p",
        "when": "editorTextFocus"
      }
    ]
  },
  "scripts": {
    "package": "npx @vscode/vsce package --allow-missing-repository --allow-star-activation",
    "publish": "npx @vscode/vsce publish",
    "q": "npx @vscode/vsce publish patch --allow-star-activation",
    "pub": "yes | npx vsce publish patch",
    "test": "echo \"Running tests...\" && exit 0"
  },
